WEBVTT

00:07:25.897 --> 00:07:30.630
we look at their real world
and, well, it looks strange,

00:07:30.663 --> 00:07:34.497
weird, bizarre, exotic
and, of course, unreal.

00:07:35.097 --> 00:07:37.130
But it has many major things in common

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:42.230
with the real world experienced
by numerous other premodern peoples,

00:07:42.263 --> 00:07:43.763
including, for example,

00:07:43.763 --> 00:07:45.230
the ancient Egyptians,

00:07:45.263 --> 00:07:46.697
ancient Chinese

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:50.363
and the peoples
of precolonial Peru, Mexico,

00:07:50.363 --> 00:07:52.963
India, Bali, Hawaii.

00:07:53.897 --> 00:07:56.363
In all of those premodern real worlds,

00:07:56.397 --> 00:07:59.263
gods controlled all
of the conditions of existence.